    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cast magic spells\u00a0in this 3d\u00a0action-adventure game. \u00a0Overcome \u00a0obstacles, solve puzzles and fight \u00a0the dark forces that have taken hold of your ancestral home.\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and old castle filled with puzzles, Obstacles\u00a0and enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find \u00a0magic runes\u00a0\u00a0and gain new abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >prepare helpful potions with the help of your grandma</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with Ghosts and Quirky characters to help you in your adventure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through the history of recovering your family's Honor.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Non Linear Exploration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our goal is to create a game with a compelling narrative, where exploration and understanding your surroundings are key to progressing, with not hand holding or auto back-tracking. And of course, there\u2019s some exciting combat along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cast magic spells\u00a0in this 3d\u00a0action-adventure game. \u00a0Overcome \u00a0obstacles, solve puzzles and fight \u00a0the dark forces that have taken hold of your ancestral home.\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and old castle filled with puzzles, Obstacles\u00a0and enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find \u00a0magic runes\u00a0\u00a0and gain new abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >prepare helpful potions with the help of your grandma</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with Ghosts and Quirky characters to help you in your adventure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through the history of recovering your family's Honor.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Non Linear Exploration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our goal is to create a game with a compelling narrative, where exploration and understanding your surroundings are key to progressing, with not hand holding or auto back-tracking. And of course, there\u2019s some exciting combat along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
